Daniel Mack wrote:
> 
> This adds support for Native Instrument's freshly announced Audio2DJ
> sound device hardware. Version number bumped to 1.3.19.
> 
> Signed-off-by: Daniel Mack <daniel@caiaq.de>
> Cc: Takashi Iwai <tiwai@suse.de>

